        "title": "Sunny Plateau flat with a cat who loves the balcony",
        "introduction": "Hi, I'm Camille! I teach at a nearby university and I'm looking for a kind sitter for my cat Pickle and my flat while I travel to see family. Pickle is a gentle, slightly shy indoor cat who warms up quickly once she knows you. You'll have the whole flat to yourself, a quiet desk to work from and a neighbourhood full of cafés to explore. I'm happy to video call before you apply, so we can make sure it's a good fit for everyone.",
