            "firstName": "Priya",
            "photoUrl": "https://i.pravatar.cc/160?img=5"
          },
          "text": "We had a lovely stay with Pickle! She's shy to begin with, but after a day of hiding under the bed she decided we were acceptable and became the sweetest lap cat. The flat is bright and spotless, and Camille's house guide made settling in effortless.",
